theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 20
text = "OUTBURST is a turn-based card battle. Your party of five faces Jeff The Crab take him down before he takes you.

• Play cards by dragging them to the play zone (the drop area) or press 1, 2, or 3 for the first three cards in your hand.
• Each card costs energy (shown at the bottom). Use it wisely attack cards deal damage to Jeff.
• Win by reducing Jeff The Crab's HP to zero. Lose if all your party members' HP reach zero first. If both happen on the same turn, you win!
• At the end of each turn, Jeff attacks one of your party members. Plan ahead and manage your health.
• Press D to draw a card, S to skip (end turn). Save your party and defeat the crab!"
horizontal_alignment = 1
vertical_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 2

